# Only admin/ (plus the two root files it needs) ever gets built into the
# image. Everything else in the repo — mobile apps, Supabase project,
# docs, git history, secrets — has no business inside a container that
# just serves the PHP portal. public/ (the transparency dashboard) was
# removed 15 Sep 2026 and dropped from this allowlist along with it.
*

!admin/
!admin/**
!index.php
!.htaccess
!docker-entrypoint.sh

# Never bake real secrets into an image layer even by accident — Render
# env vars supply these at runtime instead (see config.php's env()).
.env
.env.*
